+// BSY Media: dark theme for lists/columns - applies whenever the project's
+// "Dark mode for cards & columns" toggle is on. Directly controlled by the
+// toggle, not gated on background brightness.
+// NOTE: #app is the <body> element itself (id="app" is set on <body>, not a
